+# Refresh mode ('refresh: true') rebuilds an already released 'tag' with the newest base images and no cache and
+# pushes it over the existing '1.2.3' tag, to fix image vulnerabilities without releasing new software.
+# '1.2', '1' and 'latest' are only moved when 'floating-tags' / 'latest' are set.
