+# Authentication to the e-CODEX JFrog is done using the JFrog CLI, configured with a GitHub OIDC token.
+# The image is recorded in a JFrog build-info. BuildKit embeds an SBOM and the SLSA provenance in the image.
+# The GitHub attestation is created with an 'oci://' subject so that setup-jfrog-cli attaches it to the image
+# in Artifactory as evidence. setup-jfrog-cli publishes the build-info and the evidence at the end of the job.
 
